WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.424
The thirty centimetre pencil is longer than the ten centimetre pencil.

00:00:05.283 --> 00:00:08.441
We compare mass too. A stone is heavier than a leaf.

00:00:09.283 --> 00:00:13.593
The bucket holds eight cupfuls, while the bowl holds four of the same cupfuls.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:18.589
Eight cups is greater than four cups. The bucket has more capacity.
